{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"50e90cce97da56e4a9194377aa83f58dd1c1a734bb5b1ca8ba541a56e64328c9","ja":"私達、CM撮影で、高度4000メートルの上空から\n飛び降りるんですか～っ！？","zh":"我们要在拍广告的时候，从高度4000米的高空跳下来吗～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"45b0faa1015f9bd797de9cfc729ebe700836611b974f8f9c7f82ab45edc66c89","ja":"いきなり連れて来られて、\nスカイダイビングなんて、聞いてないぞ～っ！？","zh":"突然被带过来，\n还说什么跳伞，我可没听说过啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"dc136fc0b7668dbd588cbf9ddb1e633381e750a251864cc2adbe2a1a475c80dd","ja":"そっか！　『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』だから、\r\nスカイダイビングが得意だって勘違いされたのかも？","zh":"原来如此！因为是『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』，所以可能被误以为擅长跳伞了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ceaf383c31e447205de6000d28197d0bc14dfa74644897e43b08b8923b6b6f2a","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーは、海のダイビングの仕事だと\n思って受けたの？　勘違いにも程があるさー！？","zh":"●●●●制作人，你是以为这是海上潜水的工作才接下的吗？这误会也太离谱了吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"32577fa281fcfa9fad82f000f83f7d5b04de3e743875d7a12f57389eafd68cf5","ja":"ううっ……こわいこわいこわいこわい……。\nわ、私、もう帰りたいです～……。","zh":"呜呜……好可怕好可怕好可怕好可怕……。\n我、我已经想回去了～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9d569487762d98ed6359c55e0dd5ee78acdaf4c817410e3726d0c784d5526672","ja":"私と響ちゃんだけなら、勇気を出して\r\n飛び降りちゃえって思うんですけど、やよいが……。","zh":"如果只有我和响的话，我会觉得鼓起勇气跳下去也没关系，可是弥生她……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"498c69281efe274efc081ea3cbe08d721afc8bb222da0fcbb01b3b27e64bebcc","ja":"やよい～！　気をしっかり！\n寝たら死ぬぞー！！","zh":"弥生～！打起精神来！\n睡着了会死的哦——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3666e44333c3039c3fa88873082a5ee911b0bb588908beb573ee000bb35b9a38","ja":"響ちゃん、それは雪山だよ！","zh":"小响，那是雪山哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"db959e6bd634b9e3b7090f1928eb843a9014e1c1cb8eef43d386c43deaaf8c3b","ja":"と、とにかく、やよいには、\nスカイダイビングなんてさせられません。","zh":"总、总之，不能让弥生去跳伞。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"cc9336720c38e5b854953836410b59377412234c6cb25ea322206d6d0c2432e1","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー、責任取って、\n自分達と一緒に飛び降りてよねっ！","zh":"●●●●制作人，负起责任来，和我们一起跳下去吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_858.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0184c0fb427303eb60a39ee96b2bf7b6b5ab2ea8d81f86b069ca1978b33b7f64","ja":"それじゃあ、行くさーっ！！","zh":"那就出发啦——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
